---
title: Alert Preferences and Emailing Sequence Diagram
author: Project Sentinel
---

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Pro User (Dashboard)
    participant Backend as Sentinel Backend API
    participant Email as SendGrid Email Service

    User->>Backend: Update alert preferences (thresholds, email on/off)
    Backend->>Backend: Save preferences to database
    alt Alert triggered (meets user preferences)
        Backend->>Email: Send alert email to user
        Email-->>User: Deliver alert email
    end
    Backend-->>User: Show alert in dashboard (real-time)
    User->>User: View alert and email notification
